/*
  RaDaR® ST Post-Launch Ordering Analysis
  ========================================
  Validated against: https://neogenomics.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Report/00OVs00000IogPtMAJ/view?queryScope=userFolders
  Last validated: 2026-05-23 | 194 rows | 1:1 accession grain | 0 false positives

  PURPOSE:
    Produces a single-row-per-accession dataset of all RaDaR® ST orders since
    the January 2026 product launch. Supports post-launch commercial monitoring
    including: order velocity, variant mix, cross-sell opportunity identification,
    clinical context analysis, workflow progression tracking, specimen receipt timing,
    variant-aware TAT metrics, QNS/TNP incident outcome tracking, and operational
    status analytics with incident detail.

  GRAIN: One row per ACCESSION_HUB_ID (enterprise accession with at least one
         RaDaR® ST test ordered since 2026-01-01).

  ARCHITECTURE:
    Primary driver: DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_PANEL_TEST_DETAIL
      - Identifies RaDaR accessions via MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME ILIKE '%radar%'
      - Provides order statuses (ORDERED/CANCELLED), co-ordered test names, case numbers
      - Known gap: ~24-48 hour propagation lag for brand-new orders vs raw WORKLISTTABLE

    Gold layer (82% of output columns — 64/78):
      - V_GOLD_PANEL_TEST_DETAIL         : RaDaR test identification, variant statuses, additional tests
      - V_GOLD_ACCESSION                 : Order date, order type, bill type, disease stage, patient linkage
      - V_GOLD_CLIENT                    : Client name, number, city, state, zip, type-based exclusion
      - V_GOLD_CASE                      : Per-variant workflow date, reported date/TS, current status derivation
      - V_GOLD_PANEL                     : Co-ordered panels (same accession + cross-accession)
      - V_GOLD_ORDERING_PROVIDER_PIVOT   : Ordering provider name and NPI
      - V_GOLD_RADAR_CLINICAL_INFORMATION: Tumor type, subtype, treatment, resection date, receiving facility
      - V_GOLD_RADAR_ORDER_OPTIONS       : Blood collection plan, cadence, test count, reminder intervals
                                           (populated for First Timepoint orders only — 100% for those, 0% for Follow-ups by design)
      - V_GOLD_INCIDENT                  : QNS/TNP incidents (status, created/closed timestamps for outcome),
                                           all incident types + statuses, incident count, detail list
      - T_E_LAB_ORDER_GROUP_HUB         : Bridge from radar order options to accession hub ID

    Silver + Raw layer (18% of output columns — 14/78):
      - DL_RAW_APVX_PRD.WORKFLOW.WORKLISTTABLE :
          1. WF_STEP_* (4 cols): Granular workflow step name per variant
             (Complete, Molecular Hold, Specimen in Transit, Cancelled, Molecular Tech, etc.)
             V_GOLD_CASE only exposes high-level ORDERED/CANCELLED — not the lab step detail.
          2. PANTRACER_PANEL_NAME + HAS_PANTRACER (2 cols): PanTracer panel detection via
             PANELS_TEXT regex. PanTracer panels are not yet surfaced in Gold panel views.
      - DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.DW.T_E_SPECIMEN_HUB + T_M_SPECIMEN_TYPE_HUB (Silver):
          Specimen type filter (blood/tissue) and accession linkage.
      - DL_RAW_APVX_PRD.ORDERS.SPECIMENLOCATION (Raw):
          CHECKEDIN = 1 with CREATEDDATE as physical specimen receipt timestamp.
          Blood: uses 1st check-in (batch event IS the real blood receipt).
          Tissue: HYBRID — uses 2nd check-in when 1st is batch (<60s from blood),
          else RECEIVEDDATE fallback when no 2nd check-in, else 1st check-in if not batch.
          TISSUE_DATE_SOURCE column tracks which method was used per row.
      - DL_RAW_APVX_PRD.ORDERS.SPECIMEN (Raw):
          RECEIVEDDATE as fallback for tissue when no 2nd SPECIMENLOCATION check-in exists.
      - DL_RAW_APVX_PRD.ORDERS.CLIENT + CLIENTTYPE :
          APVX CLIENTID-level exclusion for PanTracer CTE (mirrors Gold name-pattern exclusion).

  CLIENT EXCLUSION:
    Non-production clients filtered via V_GOLD_CLIENT name-pattern matching:
    CLIENT_TYPE_NAME IN ('Proficiency Test', 'Sample') plus LIKE patterns for
    TEST, SAMPLE, QC, QUALITY CONTROL, PROFICIENCY, DEMO, VALIDATION, DUMMY, UNKNOWN.
    Catches ~15 more clients than type-only filtering.

  TAT LOGIC (variant-aware):
    - First Timepoint: TAT = REPORTED_DATE - FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED (tissue is gating specimen)
    - Follow-up Timepoint: TAT = REPORTED_DATE - FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED (blood-only test)
    - DAYS_IN_LAB uses same logic inverted (specimen receipt → today for unreported orders)

  QNS/TNP OUTCOME LOGIC:
    Determines whether a QNS/TNP incident resulted in a true failure or was rescued:
      - True QNS/TNP: Case reported on or before incident closed date (report IS the QNS finding)
      - Rescued: Case reported AFTER incident closed (client sent new specimens, test succeeded)
      - Active: Incident open, case not yet reported (awaiting resolution)
    Derived from V_GOLD_INCIDENT.CLOSED_TIMESTAMP vs REPORTED_DATE comparison.

  DETAILED_STATUS (9-value hierarchy):
    Specimen-aware status reflecting actual workflow progression:
      - Cancelled                        : All variants cancelled
      - Reported - Rescued from QNS/TNP  : Had QNS/TNP, rescue succeeded, clinical results delivered
      - Reported - QNS/TNP               : Reported with QNS/TNP finding (no rescue)
      - Reported                         : Normal report — clinical results delivered
      - QNS/TNP - Active                 : Stalled — specimen quality issue awaiting resolution
      - In Progress - Testing            : Both specimens received, lab actively testing
      - In Progress - Awaiting Blood     : Tissue in, waiting on blood draw
      - In Progress - Awaiting Tissue    : Blood in, waiting on tissue block from pathology
      - In Progress - Awaiting Specimens : Neither specimen received yet
      - Ordered                          : Order placed, not yet accessioned

  OUTPUT:
    DW_CUR_INFDLC_DEV.DW.T_RADAR_ST_POST_LAUNCH (78 columns)
    Column groups:
      [1-2]   Order metadata: date, client name
      [3-7]   RaDaR variant statuses + first timepoint flag
      [8-10]  Cross-sell: same-accession tests, all-patient tests, has_other_tests flag
      [11-16] Clinical context: tumor type/subtype/other, treatment, expression, treatment types
      [17-20] Accession identifiers: hub ID, case numbers, client number, bill type
      [21-28] Workflow tracking: step name (raw) + completion date (Gold) x 4 variants
      [29-30] Disease stage + resection date
      [31-32] APVX accession ID + order type
      [33-34] Ordering provider name + co-ordered panels
      [35-37] Client location: city, state, zip
      [38-40] Patient ID + PanTracer panel name + flag
      [41-47] Portfolio flags: panels/tests same/diff accession + summary flag
      [48-49] Ordering provider NPI + enterprise patient hub ID
      [50-52] Derived: TEST_TYPE, OVERALL_STATUS, PATIENT_ORDER_PROGRESSION
      [53-58] RaDaR order options: blood plan, cadence, test count, reminder, clinician/neo intervals
      [59]    Receiving facility
      [60-61] Case lifecycle: REPORTED_DATE, CURRENT_STATUS (Ordered/In Progress/Reported/Cancelled)
      [62-63] Specimen receipt: FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_DATE, FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_DATE (hybrid logic)
      [64-66] TAT metrics: TAT_DAYS (variant-aware), DAYS_IN_LAB (variant-aware), DAYS_TISSUE_TO_BLOOD
      [67-69] QNS/TNP: HAS_QNS_TNP flag, QNS_TNP_STATUS, QNS_TNP_OUTCOME (True QNS/TNP | Rescued | Active)
      [70-72] Incidents: INCIDENT_TYPES_LIST, INCIDENT_COUNT, DAYS_TO_QNS_TNP
      [73]    DETAILED_STATUS (9-value specimen-aware status hierarchy)
      [74-76] Binary flags: IS_REPORTED, IS_TRUE_QNS_TNP, IS_CANCELLED
      [77]    TISSUE_DATE_SOURCE (1st Check-in | 2nd Check-in | RECEIVEDDATE Fallback)
      [78]    INCIDENT_DETAIL_LIST (all incidents with type + status, e.g. "QNS/TNP (Closed); CMR (Material Received)")

  REMAINING GOLD GAPS (backlog):
    - WF_STEP_* (4 cols): Need V_GOLD_CASE to expose granular lab workflow step names
    - PANTRACER_PANEL_NAME + HAS_PANTRACER (2 cols): Need PanTracer in V_GOLD_PANEL or dedicated view
    - Specimen check-in timestamps (2 cols): Need Gold specimen view with SPECIMENLOCATION events
    - TAT/metric columns (5 cols): Derived from above — would become Gold once specimen dates are in Gold
    - TISSUE_DATE_SOURCE (1 col): Diagnostic column — can be removed once specimen logic is validated
*/

--select * FROM DW_CUR_INFDLC_DEV.DW.T_RADAR_ST_POST_LAUNCH;

TRUNCATE TABLE DW_CUR_INFDLC_DEV.DW.T_RADAR_ST_POST_LAUNCH;

INSERT INTO DW_CUR_INFDLC_DEV.DW.T_RADAR_ST_POST_LAUNCH

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 0: excluded_master_clients
-- Identifies non-production clients using Gold CLIENT_TYPE_NAME
-- AND name-pattern matching directly on V_GOLD_CLIENT.
-- Fully Gold-native — no raw table dependency for exclusion.
-- ============================================================
WITH excluded_master_clients AS (
    SELECT MASTER_CLIENT_HUB_ID
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_CLIENT
    WHERE CLIENT_TYPE_NAME IN ('Proficiency Test', 'Sample')
       OR UPPER(CLIENT_NAME) LIKE '%TEST%'
       OR UPPER(CLIENT_NAME) LIKE '%SAMPLE%'
       OR UPPER(CLIENT_NAME) LIKE '%QC %'
       OR UPPER(CLIENT_NAME) LIKE '%QUALITY CONTROL%'
       OR UPPER(CLIENT_NAME) LIKE '%PROFICIENCY%'
       OR UPPER(CLIENT_NAME) LIKE '%DEMO%'
       OR UPPER(CLIENT_NAME) LIKE '%VALIDATION%'
       OR UPPER(CLIENT_NAME) LIKE '%DUMMY%'
       OR UPPER(CLIENT_NAME) = 'UNKNOWN'
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 1: radar_gold_base
-- PRIMARY DRIVER: Identifies RaDaR accessions from Gold using
-- MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME. Pivots variant statuses and aggregates
-- non-RaDaR tests per accession in a single pass.
-- ============================================================
radar_gold_base AS (
    SELECT
        ptd.ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        ptd.ACCESSIONID,
        MAX(CASE WHEN ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME = 'RaDaR® ST First Timepoint' THEN ptd.SOURCE_TESTORDERSTATUS END) AS RADAR_STATUS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT,
        MAX(CASE WHEN ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME = 'RaDaR® ST First Timepoint (Blood)' THEN ptd.SOURCE_TESTORDERSTATUS END) AS RADAR_STATUS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT_BLOOD,
        MAX(CASE WHEN ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME = 'RaDaR® ST Follow-up Timepoint' THEN ptd.SOURCE_TESTORDERSTATUS END) AS RADAR_STATUS_FOLLOWUP_TIMEPOINT,
        MAX(CASE WHEN ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME = 'RaDaR® Process and Hold' THEN ptd.SOURCE_TESTORDERSTATUS END) AS RADAR_STATUS_PROCESS_AND_HOLD,
        CASE WHEN MAX(CASE WHEN ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME IN ('RaDaR® ST First Timepoint', 'RaDaR® ST First Timepoint (Blood)') THEN 1 END) = 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT,
        LISTAGG(DISTINCT CASE WHEN ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME NOT ILIKE '%Radar%' AND ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME IS NOT NULL THEN ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME END, '; ')
            WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY CASE WHEN ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME NOT ILIKE '%Radar%' AND ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME IS NOT NULL THEN ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME END) AS ADDITIONAL_TESTS_SAME_ACCESSION,
        LISTAGG(DISTINCT ptd.CASENO, ', ') WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY ptd.CASENO) AS CASE_NUMBERS
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_PANEL_TEST_DETAIL ptd
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_ACCESSION acc ON acc.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ptd.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
    WHERE acc.MASTER_CLIENT_HUB_ID NOT IN (SELECT MASTER_CLIENT_HUB_ID FROM excluded_master_clients)
      AND acc."ACCESSION CREATED DATETIME" >= '2026-01-01'
      AND EXISTS (
          SELECT 1 FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_PANEL_TEST_DETAIL r
          WHERE r.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ptd.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
            AND r.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME ILIKE '%radar%'
      )
    GROUP BY ptd.ACCESSION_HUB_ID, ptd.ACCESSIONID
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 2: radar_accessions
-- Enriches radar base with accession-level metadata.
-- ============================================================
radar_accessions AS (
    SELECT
        rgb.ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        rgb.ACCESSIONID,
        acc."ACCESSION CREATED DATETIME"::DATE AS ORDER_DATE,
        acc."ACCESSION ORDER TYPE" AS ACCESSION_ORDER_TYPE,
        acc.MASTER_CLIENT_HUB_ID,
        acc.DISEASE_STAGE,
        acc.ORDER_BILL_TO_INSTRUCTION AS BILL_TYPE,
        acc.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID,
        SPLIT_PART(acc.PATIENT_SOURCE_ID, '|', 4)::NUMBER AS APVX_PATIENT_ID,
        rgb.RADAR_STATUS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT,
        rgb.RADAR_STATUS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT_BLOOD,
        rgb.RADAR_STATUS_FOLLOWUP_TIMEPOINT,
        rgb.RADAR_STATUS_PROCESS_AND_HOLD,
        rgb.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT,
        rgb.ADDITIONAL_TESTS_SAME_ACCESSION,
        rgb.CASE_NUMBERS
    FROM radar_gold_base rgb
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_ACCESSION acc ON acc.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = rgb.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 3: radar_case_workflow [GOLD]
-- Per-variant workflow completion date from V_GOLD_CASE.
-- Uses CASE WORKLIST LAST COMPLETED DATETIME (added 2026-05).
-- Keeps most recent case per (accession, variant) via QUALIFY.
-- ============================================================
radar_case_workflow AS (
    SELECT
        ptd.ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME,
        gc."CASE WORKLIST LAST COMPLETED DATETIME"::DATE AS WF_DATE,
        gc."CASE FIRST COMPLETED DATETIME"::DATE AS REPORTED_DATE,
        gc."CASE FIRST COMPLETED DATETIME" AS REPORTED_TS,
        CASE
            WHEN gc."CASE ORDER STATUS" = 'CANCELLED' THEN 'Cancelled'
            WHEN gc."CASE FIRST COMPLETED DATETIME" IS NOT NULL THEN 'Reported'
            WHEN gc."CASE WORKLIST LAST COMPLETED DATETIME" IS NOT NULL THEN 'In Progress'
            ELSE 'Ordered'
        END AS CURRENT_STATUS
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_PANEL_TEST_DETAIL ptd
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_CASE gc ON gc.CASE_HUB_ID = ptd.CASE_HUB_ID
    WHERE ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME ILIKE '%radar%'
    QUALIFY ROW_NUMBER() OVER (
        PARTITION BY ptd.ACCESSION_HUB_ID, ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME
        ORDER BY gc."CASE WORKLIST LAST COMPLETED DATETIME" DESC NULLS LAST
    ) = 1
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 4: radar_workflow_step [RAW DEPENDENCY]
-- Per-variant granular workflow STEP from WORKLISTTABLE.
-- Required because V_GOLD_CASE only has ORDERED/CANCELLED —
-- not lab-level steps (Complete, Molecular Hold, Specimen in
-- Transit, Molecular Tech, Molecular Login, Cancelled).
-- Backlog item: expose granular step in V_GOLD_CASE to eliminate.
-- ============================================================
radar_workflow_step AS (
    SELECT
        ACCESSIONID,
        CASE
            WHEN PANELS_TEXT ILIKE '%(Blood) RaDaR%'   THEN 'First Timepoint (Blood)'
            WHEN PANELS_TEXT ILIKE '%First Timepoint%' THEN 'First Timepoint'
            WHEN PANELS_TEXT ILIKE '%Follow-up%'       THEN 'Follow-up Timepoint'
            WHEN PANELS_TEXT ILIKE '%Process and Hold%' THEN 'Process and Hold'
        END AS RADAR_VARIANT,
        WORKFLOWSTEP
    FROM DL_RAW_APVX_PRD.WORKFLOW.WORKLISTTABLE
    WHERE PANELS_TEXT ILIKE '%Radar%'
    QUALIFY ROW_NUMBER() OVER (
        PARTITION BY ACCESSIONID,
            CASE WHEN PANELS_TEXT ILIKE '%(Blood) RaDaR%' THEN 'First Timepoint (Blood)'
                 WHEN PANELS_TEXT ILIKE '%First Timepoint%' THEN 'First Timepoint'
                 WHEN PANELS_TEXT ILIKE '%Follow-up%' THEN 'Follow-up Timepoint'
                 WHEN PANELS_TEXT ILIKE '%Process and Hold%' THEN 'Process and Hold'
            END
        ORDER BY LASTUPDATED DESC
    ) = 1
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 5: client_info [GOLD]
-- Client name, number, and physical address from V_GOLD_CLIENT.
-- CLIENT_CITY/STATE/ZIP added to Gold 2026-05 — eliminates
-- prior dependency on CLIENTSHIPPINGADDRESS + SALESREPMAPPING.
-- Deduplicates to one row per MASTER_CLIENT_HUB_ID.
-- ============================================================
client_info AS (
    SELECT
        gc.MASTER_CLIENT_HUB_ID,
        gc.CLIENT_NAME,
        gc.CLIENT_NUMBER,
        gc.CLIENT_CITY,
        gc.CLIENT_STATE,
        gc.CLIENT_ZIP
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_CLIENT gc
    QUALIFY ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY gc.MASTER_CLIENT_HUB_ID ORDER BY gc.CLIENT_NUMBER) = 1
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 6: ordering_provider
-- Ordering provider from Gold (deduplicated per accession).
-- ============================================================
ordering_provider AS (
    SELECT
        E_ACCESSION AS ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        MAX(ORDERING_PRACTITIONER_FULL_NAME) AS ORDERING_PROVIDER_NAME,
        MAX(ORDERING_PRACTITIONER_NPI) AS ORDERING_PROVIDER_NPI
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_ORDERING_PROVIDER_PIVOT
    GROUP BY E_ACCESSION
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 7: accession_panels
-- Non-RaDaR panel names on the same accession from V_GOLD_PANEL.
-- ============================================================
accession_panels AS (
    SELECT
        p.ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        LISTAGG(DISTINCT p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME", '; ')
            WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME") AS ADDITIONAL_PANELS_SAME_ACCESSION
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_PANEL p
    WHERE p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME" IS NOT NULL
      AND p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME" != ''
      AND p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME" NOT ILIKE '%Radar%'
    GROUP BY p.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 8: cross_accession_tests
-- Non-RaDaR tests on DIFFERENT accessions for the same patient.
-- ============================================================
cross_accession_tests AS (
    SELECT
        ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID AS RADAR_ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        LISTAGG(DISTINCT ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME, '; ')
            WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME) AS TESTS_DIFF_ACCESSION
    FROM radar_accessions ra
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_ACCESSION ga2
        ON ga2.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID = ra.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID
        AND ga2.ACCESSION_HUB_ID != ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
        AND ga2."ACCESSION CREATED DATETIME" >= '2026-01-01'
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_PANEL_TEST_DETAIL ptd
        ON ptd.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ga2.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
        AND ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME IS NOT NULL
        AND ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME NOT ILIKE '%Radar%'
    GROUP BY ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 9: cross_accession_panels
-- Non-RaDaR panels on DIFFERENT accessions for the same patient.
-- ============================================================
cross_accession_panels AS (
    SELECT
        ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID AS RADAR_ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        LISTAGG(DISTINCT p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME", '; ')
            WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME") AS PANELS_DIFF_ACCESSION
    FROM radar_accessions ra
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_ACCESSION ga2
        ON ga2.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID = ra.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID
        AND ga2.ACCESSION_HUB_ID != ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
        AND ga2."ACCESSION CREATED DATETIME" >= '2026-01-01'
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_PANEL p
        ON p.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ga2.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
        AND p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME" IS NOT NULL
        AND p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME" != ''
        AND p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME" NOT ILIKE '%Radar%'
    GROUP BY ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 10: patient_all_tests_cross
-- All non-RaDaR tests across ALL accessions for same patient.
-- ============================================================
patient_all_tests_cross AS (
    SELECT
        ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID AS RADAR_ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        LISTAGG(DISTINCT ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME, '; ')
            WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME) AS ALL_OTHER_TESTS
    FROM radar_accessions ra
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_ACCESSION ga2
        ON ga2.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID = ra.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID
        AND ga2."ACCESSION CREATED DATETIME" >= '2026-01-01'
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_PANEL_TEST_DETAIL ptd
        ON ptd.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ga2.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
        AND ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME IS NOT NULL
        AND ptd.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME NOT ILIKE '%Radar%'
    GROUP BY ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 11: radar_clinical [GOLD]
-- RaDaR clinical intake: tumor type, subtype, treatment,
-- resection date, and receiving facility.
-- Sourced from V_GOLD_RADAR_CLINICAL_INFORMATION (added 2026-05).
-- 97% coverage across all RaDaR accessions.
-- ============================================================
radar_clinical AS (
    SELECT
        rci.ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        rci.TUMOR_TYPE,
        rci.TUMOR_SUBTYPE,
        rci.TUMOR_TYPE_OTHER,
        rci.TREATMENT_NAME,
        rci.TUMOR_TYPE_EXPRESSION,
        rci.TREATMENT_TYPE_LIST,
        rci.RESECTION_DATE,
        rci.RECEIVING_FACILITY
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_RADAR_CLINICAL_INFORMATION rci
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 12: patient_pantracer [GOLD]
-- PanTracer panel names for same patient in 2026.
-- Now sourced from V_GOLD_PANEL + V_GOLD_ACCESSION — eliminates
-- WORKLISTTABLE dependency. Joins on E_PATIENT_HUB_ID.
-- ============================================================
patient_pantracer AS (
    SELECT
        acc.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID,
        LISTAGG(DISTINCT p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME", '; ')
            WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME") AS PANTRACER_PANEL_NAME
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_PANEL p
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_ACCESSION acc ON acc.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = p.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
    WHERE p."MASTER PANEL ORDER NAME" ILIKE '%pantracer%'
      AND acc."ACCESSION CREATED DATETIME" >= '2026-01-01'
    GROUP BY acc.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 13: radar_order_options [GOLD]
-- RaDaR-specific order options from V_GOLD_RADAR_ORDER_OPTIONS.
-- Blood collection plan, testing cadence, test count, reminders.
-- Only populated for First Timepoint orders (by design — Follow-ups
-- inherit the original plan and don't re-capture these fields).
-- ============================================================
radar_order_options AS (
    SELECT
        log.E_ACCESSION AS ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        MAX(roo.BLOOD_COLLECTION_PLAN) AS BLOOD_COLLECTION_PLAN,
        MAX(roo.BLOOD_TESTING_CADENCE) AS BLOOD_TESTING_CADENCE,
        MAX(roo.BLOOD_TEST_COUNT) AS BLOOD_TEST_COUNT,
        MAX(roo.REMINDER_REQUEST) AS REMINDER_REQUEST,
        MAX(roo.CLINICIAN_DIRECTED_INTERVALS) AS CLINICIAN_DIRECTED_INTERVALS,
        MAX(roo.NEO_MANAGED_INTERVALS) AS NEO_MANAGED_INTERVALS
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_RADAR_ORDER_OPTIONS roo
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.DW.T_E_LAB_ORDER_GROUP_HUB log ON log.ID = roo.E_LAB_ORDER_GROUP
    GROUP BY log.E_ACCESSION
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 14: blood_specimen_received [SILVER + RAW]
-- First blood specimen physically received at lab per accession.
-- Uses SPECIMENLOCATION.CREATEDDATE where CHECKEDIN = 1 as the
-- explicit physical receipt event (consistent with tissue CTE).
-- Eliminates placeholder dates present in SPECIMEN.RECEIVEDDATE.
-- ============================================================
blood_specimen_received AS (
    SELECT
        sp.E_ACCESSION AS ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        MIN(sl.CREATEDDATE)::DATE AS FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_DATE,
        MIN(sl.CREATEDDATE) AS FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.DW.T_E_SPECIMEN_HUB sp
    JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.DW.T_M_SPECIMEN_TYPE_HUB stype ON stype.ID = sp.M_SPECIMEN_TYPE
    JOIN DL_RAW_APVX_PRD.ORDERS.SPECIMENLOCATION sl
        ON sl.SPECIMENID = SPLIT_PART(sp.SPECIMEN_SOURCE_ID, '|', 4)::NUMBER
        AND sl.CHECKEDIN = 1
    WHERE stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%blood%'
       OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%peripheral%'
    GROUP BY sp.E_ACCESSION
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 15: tissue_specimen_received [SILVER + RAW]
-- First tissue specimen physically received at lab per accession.
-- Uses SPECIMENLOCATION.CREATEDDATE where CHECKEDIN = 1 as the
-- explicit physical receipt event (tech scan-in timestamp).
-- More operationally precise than SPECIMEN.RECEIVEDDATE which
-- can be pre-populated or backfilled.
-- Tissue only present on First Timepoint orders (99% coverage
-- for those, 0% for Follow-ups — by design, tissue is required
-- for initial tumor panel build only).
-- HYBRID APPROACH:
--   Priority 1: 2nd check-in (when 1st is batch event <60s from blood)
--   Priority 2: SPECIMEN.RECEIVEDDATE (when only batch check-in exists)
--   Priority 3: 1st check-in (when it's NOT a batch event)
-- TISSUE_DATE_SOURCE column tracks which method was used.
-- ============================================================
tissue_specimen_received AS (
    SELECT
        bf.ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        COALESCE(
            CASE WHEN ABS(DATEDIFF('second', t1.CHECKIN_TS, bf.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS)) < 60 THEN t2.CHECKIN_TS END,
            CASE WHEN ABS(DATEDIFF('second', t1.CHECKIN_TS, bf.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS)) < 60 THEN tr.RECEIVED_TS END,
            t1.CHECKIN_TS
        )::DATE AS FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_DATE,
        COALESCE(
            CASE WHEN ABS(DATEDIFF('second', t1.CHECKIN_TS, bf.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS)) < 60 THEN t2.CHECKIN_TS END,
            CASE WHEN ABS(DATEDIFF('second', t1.CHECKIN_TS, bf.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS)) < 60 THEN tr.RECEIVED_TS END,
            t1.CHECKIN_TS
        ) AS FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_TS,
        CASE
            WHEN ABS(DATEDIFF('second', t1.CHECKIN_TS, bf.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS)) < 60 AND t2.CHECKIN_TS IS NOT NULL THEN '2nd Check-in'
            WHEN ABS(DATEDIFF('second', t1.CHECKIN_TS, bf.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS)) < 60 THEN 'RECEIVEDDATE Fallback'
            ELSE '1st Check-in'
        END AS TISSUE_DATE_SOURCE
    FROM blood_specimen_received bf
    LEFT JOIN (
        SELECT sp.E_ACCESSION AS ACCESSION_HUB_ID, sl.CREATEDDATE AS CHECKIN_TS
        FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.DW.T_E_SPECIMEN_HUB sp
        JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.DW.T_M_SPECIMEN_TYPE_HUB stype ON stype.ID = sp.M_SPECIMEN_TYPE
        JOIN DL_RAW_APVX_PRD.ORDERS.SPECIMENLOCATION sl ON sl.SPECIMENID = SPLIT_PART(sp.SPECIMEN_SOURCE_ID, '|', 4)::NUMBER AND sl.CHECKEDIN = 1
        WHERE stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%tissue%' OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%FFPE%'
           OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%block%' OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%paraffin%'
           OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%biopsy%' OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%slide%'
        QUALIFY ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY sp.E_ACCESSION ORDER BY sl.CREATEDDATE) = 1
    ) t1 ON t1.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = bf.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
    LEFT JOIN (
        SELECT sp.E_ACCESSION AS ACCESSION_HUB_ID, sl.CREATEDDATE AS CHECKIN_TS
        FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.DW.T_E_SPECIMEN_HUB sp
        JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.DW.T_M_SPECIMEN_TYPE_HUB stype ON stype.ID = sp.M_SPECIMEN_TYPE
        JOIN DL_RAW_APVX_PRD.ORDERS.SPECIMENLOCATION sl ON sl.SPECIMENID = SPLIT_PART(sp.SPECIMEN_SOURCE_ID, '|', 4)::NUMBER AND sl.CHECKEDIN = 1
        WHERE stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%tissue%' OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%FFPE%'
           OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%block%' OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%paraffin%'
           OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%biopsy%' OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%slide%'
        QUALIFY ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY sp.E_ACCESSION ORDER BY sl.CREATEDDATE) = 2
    ) t2 ON t2.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = bf.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
    LEFT JOIN (
        SELECT sp.E_ACCESSION AS ACCESSION_HUB_ID, MIN(apvx_sp.RECEIVEDDATE) AS RECEIVED_TS
        FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.DW.T_E_SPECIMEN_HUB sp
        JOIN DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.DW.T_M_SPECIMEN_TYPE_HUB stype ON stype.ID = sp.M_SPECIMEN_TYPE
        JOIN DL_RAW_APVX_PRD.ORDERS.SPECIMEN apvx_sp ON apvx_sp.SPECIMENID = SPLIT_PART(sp.SPECIMEN_SOURCE_ID, '|', 4)::NUMBER
        WHERE stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%tissue%' OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%FFPE%'
           OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%block%' OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%paraffin%'
           OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%biopsy%' OR stype.SPECIMEN_TYPE_NAME ILIKE '%slide%'
        GROUP BY sp.E_ACCESSION
    ) tr ON tr.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = bf.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
    WHERE t1.CHECKIN_TS IS NOT NULL
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 16: qns_tnp_incidents [GOLD]
-- QNS (Quantity Not Sufficient) / TNP (Test Not Performed)
-- incidents per accession from V_GOLD_INCIDENT.
-- Derives QNS_TNP_OUTCOME by comparing reported date vs incident
-- closed date to determine if rescue succeeded or true QNS/TNP.
-- ============================================================
qns_tnp_incidents AS (
    SELECT
        gi.ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        1 AS HAS_QNS_TNP,
        LISTAGG(DISTINCT gi.STATUS, '; ') WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY gi.STATUS) AS QNS_TNP_STATUS,
        MIN(gi.CREATED_TIMESTAMP) AS FIRST_QNS_TNP_TS,
        MAX(gi.CLOSED_TIMESTAMP) AS LAST_QNS_CLOSED_TS
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_INCIDENT gi
    WHERE gi.INCIDENT_TYPE = 'QNS/TNP'
    GROUP BY gi.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
),

-- ============================================================
-- CTE 17: all_incidents [GOLD]
-- All incident types per accession from V_GOLD_INCIDENT.
-- Provides delimited list of types and distinct count.
-- ============================================================
all_incidents AS (
    SELECT
        gi.ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
        LISTAGG(DISTINCT gi.INCIDENT_TYPE, '; ') WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY gi.INCIDENT_TYPE) AS INCIDENT_TYPES_LIST,
        COUNT(DISTINCT gi.INCIDENT_HUB_ID) AS INCIDENT_COUNT,
        LISTAGG(DISTINCT COALESCE(gi.INCIDENT_TYPE, 'CMR') || ' (' || gi.STATUS || ')', '; ')
            WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY COALESCE(gi.INCIDENT_TYPE, 'CMR') || ' (' || gi.STATUS || ')') AS INCIDENT_DETAIL_LIST
    FROM DW_ENTERPRISE_PRD.GOLD.V_GOLD_INCIDENT gi
    GROUP BY gi.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
)

-- ============================================================
-- Main SELECT: one row per RaDaR accession (69 columns)
-- Column order matches T_RADAR_ST_POST_LAUNCH DDL.
-- Window functions (ROW_NUMBER, COUNT) compute after GROUP BY.
-- ============================================================
SELECT
    ra.ORDER_DATE,
    ci.CLIENT_NAME,
    ra.RADAR_STATUS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT,
    ra.RADAR_STATUS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT_BLOOD,
    ra.RADAR_STATUS_FOLLOWUP_TIMEPOINT,
    ra.RADAR_STATUS_PROCESS_AND_HOLD,
    ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT,
    ra.ADDITIONAL_TESTS_SAME_ACCESSION,
    patc.ALL_OTHER_TESTS AS ADDITIONAL_TESTS_CROSS_ACCESSION,
    CASE WHEN patc.ALL_OTHER_TESTS IS NOT NULL AND patc.ALL_OTHER_TESTS != '' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS HAS_OTHER_TESTS,
    rc.TUMOR_TYPE,
    rc.TUMOR_SUBTYPE,
    rc.TUMOR_TYPE_OTHER,
    rc.TREATMENT_NAME,
    rc.TUMOR_TYPE_EXPRESSION,
    rc.TREATMENT_TYPE_LIST,
    ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID,
    ra.CASE_NUMBERS,
    ci.CLIENT_NUMBER,
    ra.BILL_TYPE,
    MAX(CASE WHEN rws.RADAR_VARIANT = 'First Timepoint' THEN rws.WORKFLOWSTEP END) AS WF_STEP_FIRST_TIMEPOINT,
    MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME = 'RaDaR® ST First Timepoint' THEN rcw.WF_DATE END) AS WF_DATE_FIRST_TIMEPOINT,
    MAX(CASE WHEN rws.RADAR_VARIANT = 'First Timepoint (Blood)' THEN rws.WORKFLOWSTEP END) AS WF_STEP_FIRST_TIMEPOINT_BLOOD,
    MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME = 'RaDaR® ST First Timepoint (Blood)' THEN rcw.WF_DATE END) AS WF_DATE_FIRST_TIMEPOINT_BLOOD,
    MAX(CASE WHEN rws.RADAR_VARIANT = 'Follow-up Timepoint' THEN rws.WORKFLOWSTEP END) AS WF_STEP_FOLLOWUP_TIMEPOINT,
    MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME = 'RaDaR® ST Follow-up Timepoint' THEN rcw.WF_DATE END) AS WF_DATE_FOLLOWUP_TIMEPOINT,
    MAX(CASE WHEN rws.RADAR_VARIANT = 'Process and Hold' THEN rws.WORKFLOWSTEP END) AS WF_STEP_PROCESS_AND_HOLD,
    MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.MASTER_TEST_ORDERNAME = 'RaDaR® Process and Hold' THEN rcw.WF_DATE END) AS WF_DATE_PROCESS_AND_HOLD,
    ra.DISEASE_STAGE,
    rc.RESECTION_DATE,
    ra.ACCESSIONID::NUMBER AS APVX_ACCESSION_ID,
    ra.ACCESSION_ORDER_TYPE,
    op.ORDERING_PROVIDER_NAME,
    ap.ADDITIONAL_PANELS_SAME_ACCESSION,
    ci.CLIENT_CITY,
    ci.CLIENT_STATE,
    ci.CLIENT_ZIP,
    ra.APVX_PATIENT_ID,
    ppt.PANTRACER_PANEL_NAME,
    CASE WHEN ppt.PANTRACER_PANEL_NAME IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS HAS_PANTRACER,
    CASE WHEN ap.ADDITIONAL_PANELS_SAME_ACCESSION IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS HAS_PANELS_SAME_ACCESSION,
    CASE WHEN cat.TESTS_DIFF_ACCESSION IS NOT NULL AND cat.TESTS_DIFF_ACCESSION != '' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS HAS_TESTS_DIFF_ACCESSION,
    CASE WHEN cap.PANELS_DIFF_ACCESSION IS NOT NULL AND cap.PANELS_DIFF_ACCESSION != '' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS HAS_PANELS_DIFF_ACCESSION,
    CASE WHEN ra.ADDITIONAL_TESTS_SAME_ACCESSION IS NOT NULL AND ra.ADDITIONAL_TESTS_SAME_ACCESSION != '' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS HAS_TESTS_SAME_ACCESSION,
    cat.TESTS_DIFF_ACCESSION,
    cap.PANELS_DIFF_ACCESSION,
    CASE WHEN (ra.ADDITIONAL_TESTS_SAME_ACCESSION IS NOT NULL AND ra.ADDITIONAL_TESTS_SAME_ACCESSION != '')
              OR ap.ADDITIONAL_PANELS_SAME_ACCESSION IS NOT NULL
              OR (cat.TESTS_DIFF_ACCESSION IS NOT NULL AND cat.TESTS_DIFF_ACCESSION != '')
              OR (cap.PANELS_DIFF_ACCESSION IS NOT NULL AND cap.PANELS_DIFF_ACCESSION != '')
              OR ppt.PANTRACER_PANEL_NAME IS NOT NULL
         THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS HAS_ANY_ADDITIONAL_ORDER,
    op.ORDERING_PROVIDER_NPI,
    ra.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID,
    CASE
        WHEN ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT = 1 THEN 'First Timepoint'
        WHEN ra.RADAR_STATUS_FOLLOWUP_TIMEPOINT IS NOT NULL THEN 'Follow-up Timepoint'
        WHEN ra.RADAR_STATUS_PROCESS_AND_HOLD IS NOT NULL THEN 'Process and Hold'
    END AS TEST_TYPE,
    COALESCE(ra.RADAR_STATUS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT, ra.RADAR_STATUS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT_BLOOD, ra.RADAR_STATUS_FOLLOWUP_TIMEPOINT, ra.RADAR_STATUS_PROCESS_AND_HOLD) AS OVERALL_STATUS,
    ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY ra.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID ORDER BY ra.ORDER_DATE) || ' of ' ||
        COUNT(*) OVER (PARTITION BY ra.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID) AS PATIENT_ORDER_PROGRESSION,
    roo.BLOOD_COLLECTION_PLAN,
    roo.BLOOD_TESTING_CADENCE,
    roo.BLOOD_TEST_COUNT,
    roo.REMINDER_REQUEST,
    roo.CLINICIAN_DIRECTED_INTERVALS,
    roo.NEO_MANAGED_INTERVALS,
    rc.RECEIVING_FACILITY,
    MAX(rcw.REPORTED_DATE) AS REPORTED_DATE,
    CASE
        WHEN MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS = 'Cancelled' THEN 1 END) = 1
             AND MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS IN ('Reported', 'In Progress', 'Ordered') THEN 1 END) IS NULL THEN 'Cancelled'
        WHEN MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS = 'Reported' THEN 1 END) = 1 THEN 'Reported'
        WHEN MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS = 'In Progress' THEN 1 END) = 1 THEN 'In Progress'
        ELSE 'Ordered'
    END AS CURRENT_STATUS,
    bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_DATE,
    tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_DATE,
    CASE WHEN MAX(rcw.REPORTED_TS) IS NOT NULL AND ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT = 1 AND tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_TS IS NOT NULL
         THEN ROUND(DATEDIFF('hour', tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_TS, MAX(rcw.REPORTED_TS)) / 24.0, 1)
         WHEN MAX(rcw.REPORTED_TS) IS NOT NULL AND ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT = 0 AND bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS IS NOT NULL
         THEN ROUND(DATEDIFF('hour', bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS, MAX(rcw.REPORTED_TS)) / 24.0, 1)
    END AS TAT_DAYS,
    CASE WHEN MAX(rcw.REPORTED_DATE) IS NULL AND ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT = 1 AND tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_TS IS NOT NULL
         THEN ROUND(DATEDIFF('hour', tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_TS, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()) / 24.0, 1)
         WHEN MAX(rcw.REPORTED_DATE) IS NULL AND ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT = 0 AND bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS IS NOT NULL
         THEN ROUND(DATEDIFF('hour', bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()) / 24.0, 1)
    END AS DAYS_IN_LAB,
    CASE WHEN tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_TS IS NOT NULL AND bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS IS NOT NULL
         THEN ROUND(DATEDIFF('hour', bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS, tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_TS) / 24.0, 1)
    END AS DAYS_TISSUE_TO_BLOOD,
    COALESCE(qns.HAS_QNS_TNP, 0) AS HAS_QNS_TNP,
    qns.QNS_TNP_STATUS,
    CASE
        WHEN qns.HAS_QNS_TNP IS NULL THEN NULL
        WHEN qns.LAST_QNS_CLOSED_TS IS NOT NULL AND MAX(rcw.REPORTED_DATE) > qns.LAST_QNS_CLOSED_TS::DATE THEN 'Rescued'
        WHEN qns.LAST_QNS_CLOSED_TS IS NOT NULL AND MAX(rcw.REPORTED_DATE) IS NOT NULL AND MAX(rcw.REPORTED_DATE) <= qns.LAST_QNS_CLOSED_TS::DATE THEN 'True QNS/TNP'
        WHEN qns.LAST_QNS_CLOSED_TS IS NULL AND MAX(rcw.REPORTED_DATE) IS NOT NULL THEN 'True QNS/TNP'
        WHEN MAX(rcw.REPORTED_DATE) IS NULL THEN 'Active'
    END AS QNS_TNP_OUTCOME,
    ai.INCIDENT_TYPES_LIST,
    COALESCE(ai.INCIDENT_COUNT, 0) AS INCIDENT_COUNT,
    CASE WHEN qns.FIRST_QNS_TNP_TS IS NOT NULL AND tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_TS IS NOT NULL
         THEN ROUND(DATEDIFF('hour', tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_TS, qns.FIRST_QNS_TNP_TS) / 24.0, 1)
    END AS DAYS_TO_QNS_TNP,
    CASE
        WHEN MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS = 'Cancelled' THEN 1 END) = 1
             AND MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS IN ('Reported', 'In Progress', 'Ordered') THEN 1 END) IS NULL
            THEN 'Cancelled'
        WHEN MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS = 'Reported' THEN 1 END) = 1 AND COALESCE(qns.HAS_QNS_TNP, 0) = 1
             AND qns.LAST_QNS_CLOSED_TS IS NOT NULL AND MAX(rcw.REPORTED_DATE) > qns.LAST_QNS_CLOSED_TS::DATE
            THEN 'Reported - Rescued from QNS/TNP'
        WHEN MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS = 'Reported' THEN 1 END) = 1 AND COALESCE(qns.HAS_QNS_TNP, 0) = 1
            THEN 'Reported - QNS/TNP'
        WHEN MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS = 'Reported' THEN 1 END) = 1
            THEN 'Reported'
        WHEN COALESCE(qns.HAS_QNS_TNP, 0) = 1 AND MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS = 'Reported' THEN 1 END) IS NULL
            THEN 'QNS/TNP - Active'
        WHEN ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT = 1 AND tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_DATE IS NOT NULL AND bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_DATE IS NOT NULL
            THEN 'In Progress - Testing'
        WHEN ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT = 1 AND tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_DATE IS NOT NULL AND bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_DATE IS NULL
            THEN 'In Progress - Awaiting Blood'
        WHEN ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT = 1 AND tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_DATE IS NULL AND bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_DATE IS NOT NULL
            THEN 'In Progress - Awaiting Tissue'
        WHEN ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT = 0 AND bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_DATE IS NOT NULL
            THEN 'In Progress - Testing'
        WHEN ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT = 0 AND bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_DATE IS NULL
            THEN 'In Progress - Awaiting Blood'
        WHEN tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_DATE IS NULL AND bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_DATE IS NULL
            THEN 'In Progress - Awaiting Specimens'
        ELSE 'Ordered'
    END AS DETAILED_STATUS,
    CASE WHEN MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS = 'Reported' THEN 1 END) = 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS IS_REPORTED,
    CASE WHEN COALESCE(qns.HAS_QNS_TNP, 0) = 1
              AND (qns.LAST_QNS_CLOSED_TS IS NULL OR MAX(rcw.REPORTED_DATE) IS NULL OR MAX(rcw.REPORTED_DATE) <= qns.LAST_QNS_CLOSED_TS::DATE)
              AND MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS = 'Reported' THEN 1 END) = 1
         THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS IS_TRUE_QNS_TNP,
    CASE WHEN MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS = 'Cancelled' THEN 1 END) = 1
              AND MAX(CASE WHEN rcw.CURRENT_STATUS IN ('Reported', 'In Progress', 'Ordered') THEN 1 END) IS NULL
         THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS IS_CANCELLED,
    tsr.TISSUE_DATE_SOURCE,
    ai.INCIDENT_DETAIL_LIST
FROM radar_accessions ra
LEFT JOIN client_info ci
    ON ci.MASTER_CLIENT_HUB_ID = ra.MASTER_CLIENT_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN radar_workflow_step rws
    ON rws.ACCESSIONID = ra.ACCESSIONID::NUMBER
LEFT JOIN radar_case_workflow rcw
    ON rcw.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN ordering_provider op
    ON op.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN accession_panels ap
    ON ap.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN cross_accession_tests cat
    ON cat.RADAR_ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN cross_accession_panels cap
    ON cap.RADAR_ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN patient_all_tests_cross patc
    ON patc.RADAR_ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN radar_clinical rc
    ON rc.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN patient_pantracer ppt
    ON ppt.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID = ra.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN radar_order_options roo
    ON roo.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN blood_specimen_received bsr
    ON bsr.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN tissue_specimen_received tsr
    ON tsr.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN qns_tnp_incidents qns
    ON qns.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
LEFT JOIN all_incidents ai
    ON ai.ACCESSION_HUB_ID = ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID
GROUP BY
    ra.ORDER_DATE, ci.CLIENT_NAME,
    ra.RADAR_STATUS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT, ra.RADAR_STATUS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT_BLOOD,
    ra.RADAR_STATUS_FOLLOWUP_TIMEPOINT, ra.RADAR_STATUS_PROCESS_AND_HOLD,
    ra.IS_FIRST_TIMEPOINT, ra.ADDITIONAL_TESTS_SAME_ACCESSION, patc.ALL_OTHER_TESTS,
    rc.TUMOR_TYPE, rc.TUMOR_SUBTYPE, rc.TUMOR_TYPE_OTHER,
    rc.TREATMENT_NAME, rc.TUMOR_TYPE_EXPRESSION, rc.TREATMENT_TYPE_LIST,
    ra.ACCESSION_HUB_ID, ra.CASE_NUMBERS, ci.CLIENT_NUMBER, ra.BILL_TYPE,
    ra.DISEASE_STAGE, rc.RESECTION_DATE, ra.ACCESSIONID, ra.ACCESSION_ORDER_TYPE,
    op.ORDERING_PROVIDER_NAME, ap.ADDITIONAL_PANELS_SAME_ACCESSION,
    ci.CLIENT_CITY, ci.CLIENT_STATE, ci.CLIENT_ZIP,
    ra.APVX_PATIENT_ID, ppt.PANTRACER_PANEL_NAME,
    cat.TESTS_DIFF_ACCESSION, cap.PANELS_DIFF_ACCESSION,
    op.ORDERING_PROVIDER_NPI, ra.E_PATIENT_HUB_ID,
    roo.BLOOD_COLLECTION_PLAN, roo.BLOOD_TESTING_CADENCE, roo.BLOOD_TEST_COUNT,
    roo.REMINDER_REQUEST, roo.CLINICIAN_DIRECTED_INTERVALS, roo.NEO_MANAGED_INTERVALS,
    rc.RECEIVING_FACILITY, bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_DATE, bsr.FIRST_BLOOD_RECEIVED_TS,
    tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_DATE, tsr.FIRST_TISSUE_RECEIVED_TS, tsr.TISSUE_DATE_SOURCE,
    qns.HAS_QNS_TNP, qns.QNS_TNP_STATUS, qns.FIRST_QNS_TNP_TS, qns.LAST_QNS_CLOSED_TS,
    ai.INCIDENT_TYPES_LIST, ai.INCIDENT_COUNT, ai.INCIDENT_DETAIL_LIST;



--select * FROM DW_CUR_INFDLC_DEV.DW.T_RADAR_ST_POST_LAUNCH
